    <string name="menu_help">Help</string>
    <string name="help_message">Use the keypad to enter numbers and operators. Tap = to compute. Use the history icon for past calculations and the arrows icon to show scientific functions.</string>
    <string name="help_content_full">• Basic calculator: Tap numbers and operators (+, −, ×, ÷). Tap = for the result. Use AC to clear, ( ) for parentheses.\n\n• Scientific mode: Tap \"Scientific mode\" above the keypad to show extra keys (√, π, sin, cos, tan, etc.).\n\n• History: Past calculations appear in the list. Tap \"Use\" on any item to load it and edit or continue.\n\n• Modes: Open the menu (☰) to switch to Temperature, EMI, Interest, Currency, or Date Calculator.\n\n• Theme: Use the 3-dot menu → Choose theme for Light, Dark, or System default.</string>
